    "contract": "assurance_kernel/task_intent/v1",
    "task_id": "tracker-slice-title-redelivery",
    "goal": "Child Issue titles carry each TaskIntent's slice ID instead of its position, and a Child closed `not_planned` by a stopped run that is later delivered ends closed `completed` (Spec branch-boundary-r2-followups D10).",
